# Turborepo Rules

## Monorepo Struktur
- apps/frontend → React App
- apps/backend → FastAPI (separater Python Service)
- packages/shared → geteilte TypeScript Types

## Wichtig
- Backend (Python/FastAPI) läuft NICHT in Turborepo Pipeline
- Turborepo nur für Frontend und shared packages
- Backend eigene Railway Service
- Shared Types in packages/shared/types/
